{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>The remnant of the perisher.</b> Even though the sovereignty of all the nations will eventually cease, as it says: וּשְׁאָר חֵיוָתָא הֶעְדִּיו שָׁלְטָנְהוֹן (Daniel 7:12), nevertheless the nations will not perish entirely — except for these two: Amalek, who began to wage war against Israel, and Kittim, who completed Israel's destruction, as it says: וְגַם הוּא עֲדֵי אֹבֵד (Numbers 24:24)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:04.835299243Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}